{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "otto-ai-backend-v2",
		"name": "Otto AI Backend v2",
		"description": "API collection for Otto AI Backend - AI-powered Revenue Intelligence Platform\n\n**Authentication:**\n- All protected endpoints require a valid JWT access token in the Authorization header (Bearer token)\n- Use POST /auth/signup or POST /auth/login to obtain access_token and refresh_token\n- Use POST /auth/refresh to get a new access_token using your refresh_token\n- Access tokens expire after a configured time (default: 15 minutes)\n- Refresh tokens have a longer expiration (default: 7 days)\n\n**Public Endpoints (No JWT required):**\n- POST /auth/signup - Register new user\n- POST /auth/login - Login with email/password\n- POST /auth/refresh - Refresh access token\n- POST /webhooks/* - Webhook endpoints (called by external services)\n- GET /health - Health check\n\n**Protected Endpoints (JWT required):**\n- GET /auth/me - Get current user info\n- GET /calls - List calls (requires EXECUTIVE or CSR role)\n- GET /calls/{call_id} - Get call by ID (requires EXECUTIVE or CSR role)\n- POST /rag/ask-otto - Query Ask Otto (requires EXECUTIVE role)",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "base_url",
			"value": "http://127.0.0.1:8001",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "access_token",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string",
			"description": "JWT access token - Obtained from /auth/signup or /auth/login. Required for all protected endpoints."
		},
		{
			"key": "refresh_token",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string",
			"description": "JWT refresh token - Obtained from /auth/signup or /auth/login. Use with /auth/refresh to get new access token."
		},
		{
			"key": "company_id",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string",
			"description": "Company UUID - will be populated after signup/login"
		},
		{
			"key": "call_id",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string",
			"description": "Call UUID - will be populated after creating a call"
		}
	],
